1
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,640
Accidental physical contact

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,640
Energy crystal power increased by 1%

3
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,960
A hug increased it by 3%

4
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:24,680
A kiss raised it by 10%

5
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,840
The spaceship was damaged during its landing on Earth

6
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,480
To contact Lanke Star,

7
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,400
we must fully recharge the energy crystals.

8
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,600
Now I have to get her to kiss me.

9
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:50,640
Hao Ruichi.

10
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:51,880
I’m going out to buy something.

11
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:52,560
Do you need anything?

12
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,560
Why didn’t you knock before coming in?

13
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:58,680
So our little Ruichi has this kind of hobby, huh?

14
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,000
Well, I won’t disturb you then.

15
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:01,760
Carry on.

16
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:02,440
Good luck.

17
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:03,040
Keep it up.

18
00:01:03,120 --> 00:01:03,680
You can do it.

19
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:06,480
No way.

20
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,760
How could I, a noble envoy, beg for a kiss from someone like this?

21
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,400
I need to think of a plan.

22
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:20,680
This won’t work.

23
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:22,920
I must quickly think of a way to execute the plan.

24
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:37,760
What are you doing?

25
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,480
I...

26
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:43,680
I’m getting my coat to go out with you.

27
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,720
Crazy.

28
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,880
So strange.

29
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:52,240
Isn’t this how it always goes in movies?

30
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,480
Why doesn’t the wall slam trick work at all?

31
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:00,080
Usually, you don’t even want to step out of the door.

32
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,320
What’s gotten into you today?

33
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,560
Coming out shopping with me?

34
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,280
Sometimes, going out for a stroll

35
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:06,880
to learn about the life of Earthlings

36
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:07,880
is quite nice too.

37
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:11,080
Our little Ruichi is becoming more sensible.

38
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:15,079
If you call me little Ruichi one more time,

39
00:02:15,679 --> 00:02:17,840
I’ll take you back to Lanke Star for research!

40
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:21,320
Oh, I’m so scared.

41
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:29,480
Sorry.

42
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:30,960
For the greater good,

43
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,440
I have to do this.

44
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,360
No, no...

45
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,760
Are you okay?

46
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,600
Who threw this soda can?

47
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:57,720
Such bad manners.

48
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:01,640
Damn it.

49
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:02,960
Just a little more.

50
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:16,720
No way.

51
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,760
I can't hesitate anymore.

52
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,080
I need to replenish my energy first.

53
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:19,760
I...

54
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,600
What's wrong with you?

55
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:27,480
Forget it.

56
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,280
I better just tell her the truth.

57
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,360
Qi Miao...

58
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:32,440
I need to talk to you.

59
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:32,960
Go ahead.

60
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:37,360
Actually, that accidental kiss we had...

61
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,400
unexpectedly replenished the energy in my crystal.

62
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:41,840
I suspect...

63
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:44,440
that kissing you...

64
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,120
is a way to recharge my energy crystal.

65
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,280
So I was thinking...

66
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:51,320
Um...

67
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,120
Hao Ruichi!

68
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:56,800
Come quickly!

69
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:02,760
Here!

70
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,680
Come and try this!

71
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:08,040
It's an ice magic treat from Earth!

72
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:12,880
Go ahead, try it!

73
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,559
Are you stupid?

74
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:28,480
Ice cream is meant to be eaten slowly, bit by bit.

75
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,360
Look, like this.

76
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,400
What’s wrong with you?

77
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,440
Because of that kiss earlier...

78
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,720
my crystal got recharged with energy.

79
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,320
So I thought...

80
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:15,360
What do you mean, 'so you thought'?!

81
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,000
Do you even know this kind of behavior...

82
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,240
is considered harassment here on Earth?!

83
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,760
The last person who did something like this...

84
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:20,800
got locked up already.

85
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:21,960
You're insane.

86
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:29,120
Weird...

87
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:31,240
Why didn’t the crystal react this time?

88
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:33,320
Could I have been wrong?

89
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,160
What is this?

90
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:44,800
This food is terrible.

91
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:47,440
Hey, boss!

92
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,920
Is this dish even meant for people?!

93
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:50,720
What's wrong?

94
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,360
Is there something you're not satisfied with?

95
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:53,200
Satisfied.

96
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,080
Take a good look yourself.

97
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,640
I ordered spicy chicken with diced chili.

98
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:58,800
You put so much meat in it,

99
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,080
and not a single chili.

100
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,000
Tell me,

101
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,000
how am I supposed to be satisfied?

102
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,200
Sorry.

103
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,400
Since you're the

104
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,680
very first official customers of our place,

105
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:07,760
I thought I'd be generous with the portions.

106
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:08,960
No, no.

107
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,320
Your food tastes this bad,

108
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:13,760
how dare you even think of opening a restaurant like others?

109
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:14,760
My apologies.

110
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:15,760
I'm really sorry.

111
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,600
How about I make a fresh plate for you?

112
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,280
Forget it. I've lost my appetite.

113
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:23,680
Then, how about I waive the bill for this meal?

114
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:25,560
Let's call it a grand opening promotion, okay?

115
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:27,880
Is waiving the bill enough?

116
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:29,960
After eating something this bad,

117
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:30,760
tell me,

118
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:32,400
who's going to compensate for the emotional damage?

119
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,080
What's going on here, you two?

120
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,280
What's going on?

121
00:06:35,880 --> 00:06:37,280
Who cooked this dish?

122
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,360
Why does it taste so awful?

123
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:40,600
The dish was cooked by me.

124
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,040
From the smell of cooking oil on you both,

125
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,600
and the grease stains on your cuffs,

126
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:46,760
I can tell

127
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,280
that the two of you

128
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:50,200
are also running a restaurant, right?

129
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,600
So what?

130
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,920
Just because we own a restaurant we can't be customers?

131
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:58,640
As someone who also creates delicious food

132
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,960
to bring happiness to others,

133
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:01,160
how could you act so dishonorably

134
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,640
to bully your peers like this?

135
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,360
Are you out of your mind?

136
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:06,640
Enough.

137
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:07,720
Today just isn't our day.

138
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:08,960
Let's go.

139
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:09,840
Wait a minute.

140
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:10,920
What are you doing?

141
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:13,280
The food someone puts their whole heart into making

142
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,400
shouldn't be insulted like this.

143
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,200
shouldn't be insulted like this.

144
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,040
This guy must have watched too many dramas.

145
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:18,960
Bro, let's go.

146
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,840
Why don't you try it yourself to see if it tastes bad?

147
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:24,600
Alright.

148
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,120
I'll eat it.

149
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:26,840
It's fine.

150
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:27,680
I'm just hungry anyway.

151
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:55,800
I don't think it tastes bad.

152
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:00,160
What in the world...

153
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,400
This guy is clearly not right in the head.

154
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:02,080
Let's go.

155
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:08,760
Ait!

156
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,880
Are you okay?

157
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:11,800
Idiot.

158
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:13,360
Why do you even bother with people like that?

159
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:14,600
If you don't teach them a lesson,

160
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,640
they'll just come back next time.

161
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,720
Ait!

162
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,960
Do you think I'm really not cut out to be a cook?

163
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:27,200
Don't doubt yourself.

164
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,080
This is just a necessary step

165
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:29,840
on the road to pursuing culinary excellence.

166
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:30,680
Do you understand?

167
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:00,480
Um...

168
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:01,720
Our shop just opened,

169
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:03,080
so I'll head out to hand out some flyers.

170
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:03,840
I'll do it.

171
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,840
This is a good chance for you to practice more.

172
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:07,400
Alright.

173
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:16,560
I never expected

174
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,440
her to actually be this cute.

175
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,160
No. 18 Sakura Street.

176
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,680
If someone shows interest in this jade,

177
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,360
tell them to go to No. 18 Sakura Street

178
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:31,200
and find Boss Qi.

179
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:34,680
Hao Ruichi should be somewhere nearby.

180
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,400
So he really is here.

181
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,680
How exactly do I replenish my energy?

182
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:01,240
Could his crystal be damaged too?
